OL,3,GNEWSAOrange shoes in shop windows for  
OL,4,Awomen's rights                         
OL,6,FShop windows across Guernsey are set to
OL,7,Ffeature orange shoes as part of an     
OL,8,Finternational campaign to stop violence
OL,9,Fagainst women and girls.               
OL,11,FFrom Wednesday, members of Soroptimist 
OL,12,FInternational Guernsey will be taking  
OL,13,Fpart in the UN's Orange the World 16   
OL,14,FDays of Activism by helping install    
OL,15,Fshoes in locations at St Peter Port,   
OL,16,FVale, St Sampson, Castel and Saint     
OL,17,FMartin.                                
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
