OL,3,GNEWSAOrange shoes in shop windows for  
OL,4,Awomen's rights                         
OL,6,FEach shoe was to be accompanied with a 
OL,7,Fnote explaining its purpose, and also  
OL,8,Fcontact details if people needed to    
OL,9,Fseek support relating to domestic      
OL,10,Fabuse, campaigners said.               
OL,12,FCathy Bailey, from Soroptimist         
OL,13,FInternational Guernsey, said about 150 
OL,14,Fshops took part in 2025, and she hoped 
OL,15,Fa similar number would take part again.
